# Converge

> Converge is the AI-native growth platform for DTC. Agentic media buying powered by industry-leading server-side conversion tracking and real-time multi-touch attribution. Optimizing $billions in ad spend for some of the world's best DTC growth teams, including Hims & Hers, Rove Concepts, Vision Healthcare, Everyday Dose, and Loop Earplugs. Backed by Y Combinator and General Catalyst.

