Converge ships two product suites that share one source of truth:

- Agentic Marketing: agents that act on your data. A media-buying agent you train on your own playbook, an MCP layer that lets Claude, ChatGPT, or Slack query your marketing stack in natural language, and Routines that run recurring analyses on a schedule.
- Measurement: the data foundation underneath. Server-side conversion tracking that survives iOS, ad blockers, and consent. Real-time multi-touch attribution on first-party data. A marketing analytics canvas that blends ad spend, site behavior, and revenue.

Built for DTC growth teams that have outgrown last-click dashboards and plug-and-play AI tools that do not know their account.

